//RS //! Canonical typed ambient host context for interpreter/deopt execution.
//RS //!
//RS //! The comptime interpreter owns callback storage. This module owns the one
//RS //! adapter context that composes feature services and installs those callbacks
//RS //! for a run. Feature modules register function pointers here; they do not
//RS //! create their own thread-local hooks or reimplement MIR marshalling.
//RS 
